I also did today freeCodeCamps Coding Challange:
Given a Unix timestamp in milliseconds, return the day of the week.

Valid return days are:

"Sunday"
"Monday"
"Tuesday"
"Wednesday"
"Thursday"
"Friday"
"Saturday"
Be sure to ignore time zones.

I used a simple if-else statement.
